/ inner goal sets variable visible to caller — fresh-name leak (LoadUser pattern)
Start
- set %x% = "before"
- call InnerGoal
- assert %x% equals "modified"

/ foreach item visible in called goal
- add "alpha" to list %items%
- add "beta" to list %items%
- set %captured% = ""
- foreach %items%, call CaptureItem item=%item%
- assert %captured% contains "alpha"
- assert %captured% contains "beta"

/ a parameter is the callee's own: changing it inside doesn't reach the caller, and it ends with the call
/ (the plan's rule: test/plan/app-systems/module/goal/call/ParameterEndsWithTheCall); a fresh name the callee
/ sets still lands with the caller
- call InnerWithParam id=42
- assert %id% is null, "the parameter ends with the call"
- assert %user% equals "alice"
